object\"}}},\"description\":\"Successful response with Pokémon details\"},\"400\":{\"description\":\"Bad request\"},\"404\":{\"description\":\"Pokémon not found\"},\"500\":{\"description\":\"Internal server error\"}},\"securitySource\":\"unspecified\"}"
